  {"date": "2015-12-31", "venue": "Madison Square Garden", "city": "New York", "state": "NY", "gap": 2, "set": "3", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Awesome NYE prank version. The jam begins in a mellow zone with sprinkles of bliss. After a sparse, ambient section, Fish kicks things back into a solid groove, before \"Drive-In Jam\"-like effects and sounds overtake. Must-hear Phish. Note: a few minutes were probably pre-recorded as part of the NYE \"gag\".", "out": ">", "next": "Auld Lang Syne", "xprev": "Twist", "nb": 1},
